*Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 18.33 seconds<sup>550f</sup>, delay 38.33~40 seconds<sup>1,150f~1,200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 38.33~40 seconds<sup>1,150f~1,200f</sup>.
